{"step_index":958,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T21:59:06Z","thinking":"**Analyzing UI Color Design**\n\nI'm currently immersed in the color palette and UI architecture. I've pinpointed the primary brand colors, including a deep sacred forest green for the dark theme root and a heavenly radiant gold for accents and highlights. I'm focusing on how these colors will integrate into the cards, containers, and headers, ensuring a cohesive and visually appealing design.\n\n\n**Defining Color Application**\n\nI've fleshed out the color system further, detailing the applications for specific elements. I've chosen colors, including a pressed gold and badge backgrounds. Living white, warm light accents, deep sky blue, and warm earth tones are incorporated now. Plus, I have outlined status indicators, and I'm reviewing every component, like app and navigation backgrounds and theme-color in the HTML.\n\n\n**Mapping Element Colors**\n\nI've been mapping specific color applications to UI elements in the lists, scan sheet, and dialer HUD screens. The header colors are sorted out, and I'm fleshing out all of the nuances: the KPI strip with its background, border, and numbers; the 1-tap power dialer CTA with its glowing accents; the search bar; the filter tabs, with active states; the educator cards; and the call button. I have also decided on the color treatments for card verification inputs, modals, and the power dialing HUD. I'm focusing on consistency across components and screens.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/**\n * 5 Trees Fellowship Official Color Palette & Mobile Design Tokens\n * Website: 5treesfellowship.church\n */\nexport const Colors = {\n  // Brand Core Colors\n  sacredGreen: '#244931',\n  sacredGreenDark: '#1A3524',\n  sacredGreenDeep: '#14291B',\n  sacredGreenLight: '#2D5A3D',\n  \n  heavenlyGold: '#D4AF37',\n  heavenlyGoldLight: '#E6C86E',\n  heavenlyGoldDark: '#B3901D',\n  heavenlyGoldMuted: 'rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15)',\n  heavenlyGoldBorder: 'rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.35)',\n\n  livingWhite: '#FCFCFA',\n  livingOffWhite: '#F4F4F0',\n  warmEarthBrown: '#56413B',\n  deepSkyBlue: '#0077BE',\n  deepSkyBlueLight: '#38A3E5',\n  deepSkyBlueMuted: 'rgba(0, 119, 190, 0.15)',\n\n  // Mobile App Backgrounds & Card Layers\n  bgDark: '#0E1D13',\n  bgPrimary: '#14291B',\n  bgCard: '#1A3624',\n  bgCardElevated: '#21422D',\n  bgInput: '#0E1D13',\n  bgModal: 'rgba(14, 29, 19, 0.92)',\n\n  // Borders & Dividers\n  borderSubtle: '#264A32',\n  borderMedium: '#315C3F',\n  borderGold: '#D4AF37',\n\n  // Typography\n  textPrimary: '#FCFCFA',\n  textSecondary: '#DCDCD2',\n  textMuted: '#98A89C',\n  textGold: '#D4AF37',\n  textDark: '#14291B',\n\n  // Status & Disposition Badges\n  statusSitDownBg: '#1D452B',\n  statusSitDownText: '#5CE488',\n  statusCallbackBg: 'rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2)',\n  statusCallbackText: '#F3D061',\n  statusPendingBg: 'rgba(0, 119, 190, 0.2)',\n  statusPendingText: '#5BB7F5',\n  statusUnansweredBg: '#243B2C',\n  statusUnansweredText: '#A8B8AC',\n  statusDangerBg: 'rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15)',\n  statusDangerText: '#F87171',\n};\n","Description":"Theme design tokens matching 5treesfellowship.church palette","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer\\src\\theme\\colors.ts","toolAction":"Writing src/theme/colors.ts design tokens","toolSummary":"Create theme tokens in colors.ts"}}]}
